codex
I found a concrete contract bug in the `event-fast-par` host: when partitions are independent, it sums per-worker `loops`, which over-reports global iterations and can break `maxLoops` semantics. I’m patching only that aggregation path in the parallel host and then I’ll verify it with a small local harness.
